sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant WebApp as Web App
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant PaymentService as Payment Service

    Customer->>WebApp: Click checkout
    activate WebApp
    WebApp->>API: POST /checkout
    activate API
    
    Note over WebApp,API: Processing order details
    
    API->>PaymentService: Authorize payment
    activate PaymentService
    
    alt Payment approved
        PaymentService-->>API: Success
    else Payment declined
        PaymentService-->>API: Error
    end
    
    deactivate PaymentService
    
    loop Retry up to 3 times
        API->>API: Validate order
    end
    
    API-->>WebApp: 201 Created
    deactivate API
    
    WebApp-->>Customer: Order confirmed
    deactivate WebApp
    
    Note over Customer,PaymentService: Order complete
